OpenBSD has no ptsname_r and does not acquire the controlling terminal just
by opening the pty slave: like FreeBSD/macOS it has to call TIOCSCTTY (see
login_tty(3)).  Add an OpenBSD get_slave_name based on ptsname(3) and route
OpenBSD to the TIOCSCTTY branch of make_controlling_tty.

Index: src/lib.rs
